#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "In versions of glibc up to and including 2.2.1, B<dirname> does not "
#| "correctly handle pathnames with trailing '/' characters, and generates a "
#| "segmentation violation if given a NULL argument."
msgid ""
"Before glibc 2.2.1, the glibc version of B<dirname>()  did not correctly "
"handle pathnames with trailing \\[aq]/\\[aq] characters, and generated a "
"segfault if given a NULL argument."
msgstr ""
"Em versões da glibc a partir da 2.2.1 (inclusive), B<dirname> não trata "
"corretamente nomes de caminhos com caracteres '/' subseqüentes, e gera uma "
"violação de segmentação caso um argumento NULO seja fornecido."

